support_faq_eyebrow = Find your answer here
support_faq_title = Frequently asked questions
support_faq_secure = Is your website secure?
    .answer = Yes: everything you enter travels encrypted, and payment is handled by Stripe. The shop never sees your card number.
support_faq_publisher = Who publishes and hosts this site?
    .answer = The publisher and the host of the site are named in our legal notice.
support_faq_delivery_time = How long does delivery take?
    .answer = Your order is prepared, then shipped with parcel tracking. The countries we deliver to, the costs and the times are given in our shipping policy.
support_faq_tracking = How do I track my parcel?
    .answer = As soon as your order ships, we send you an e-mail with the tracking link. Your order also shows its status on the My account page.
support_faq_cancellation = Can I cancel my order?
    .answer = As long as the order has not shipped, write to us and we cancel it. Once it has shipped, you have 14 days after delivery to send it back to us.
support_faq_return = Would you like to return a product?
    .answer = Write to us from this page: we tell you how to proceed. The item comes back complete and in good condition; the refund is made within 14 days of our receiving it.
support_faq_returns_policy = Where can I read about your returns policy?
    .answer = You have 14 days after delivery to change your mind, without having to give a reason. An item that arrived damaged is replaced or refunded, return costs included. The details are in our refund policy.
